WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.425 --> 00:00:16.266
Agnes watched Ellen grow up.

2
00:00:19.589 --> 00:00:22.111
The witch was proud of her gravity spell.

3
00:00:22.131 --> 00:00:28.896
"The king and queen worry about Ellen all the time," she thought happily.

4
00:00:30.504 --> 00:00:34.147
"Their daughter will be light and silly forever!"

5
00:00:37.851 --> 00:00:41.774
Then one day at the lake, Agnes saw Ellen swimming.

6
00:00:44.076 --> 00:00:47.620
The princess dived and floated, laughing with delight.

7
00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:53.044
"Grr!" Agnes' eyes flashed blue.

8
00:00:53.064 --> 00:00:56.708
"I should have thought of the water!

9
00:00:57.588 --> 00:01:00.529
It's the one place where the princess is free!"

10
00:01:03.290 --> 00:01:06.490
Back at home, the angry witch paced back and forth.

11
00:01:06.510 --> 00:01:12.592
"I'll cast a new spell, a better one," she thought.

12
00:01:12.612 --> 00:01:16.293
"Ellen will lose her beloved lake.

13
00:01:17.173 --> 00:01:20.374
And the kingdom will lose all its water!"

14
00:01:23.655 --> 00:01:26.716
Agnes hurried to a chest for some dried seaweed.

15
00:01:29.532 --> 00:01:32.354
She threw it into a tub of water with powder.

16
00:01:33.255 --> 00:01:36.017
Chanting a spell, she began to stir.

17
00:01:36.938 --> 00:01:40.060
Soon a creature rose from the tub, hissing.

18
00:01:41.281 --> 00:01:43.843
It was a water dragon with shimmering scales.

19
00:01:50.367 --> 00:01:52.249
The witch put it on her shoulders.

20
00:01:53.410 --> 00:01:56.292
"Now I must get the keys to all the cellars."

21
00:01:57.852 --> 00:02:01.153
Agnes grabbed a huge key ring with a hundred keys.

22
00:02:02.514 --> 00:02:04.914
Then she went to a cellar door and unlocked it.

23
00:02:07.155 --> 00:02:09.756
She went down a few steps and came to another door.

24
00:02:12.117 --> 00:02:16.418
She unlocked that one, climbing down more steps to another door.

25
00:02:19.179 --> 00:02:23.100
She kept doing this until one hundred doors were unlocked.

26
00:02:28.124 --> 00:02:31.286
At the bottom of all the steps was a huge cave.

27
00:02:32.707 --> 00:02:35.629
Its ceiling was held up by rock pillars.

28
00:02:37.930 --> 00:02:40.172
Gazing at the ceiling, the witch cackled.

29
00:02:43.093 --> 00:02:45.575
Above it was the bottom of the lake!

30
00:02:50.418 --> 00:02:53.320
Agnes lifted the dragon, who stretched upward.

31
00:02:55.292 --> 00:02:58.374
It circled its head, looking for something on the ceiling.

32
00:03:01.056 --> 00:03:03.298
Suddenly it darted toward a stone.

33
00:03:03.318 --> 00:03:05.479
"You found it!"

34
00:03:05.980 --> 00:03:06.660
the witch said.

35
00:03:06.680 --> 00:03:10.523
"Drain the lake dry, my beauty!"

36
00:03:11.423 --> 00:03:14.125
The dragon latched onto the stone tightly.

37
00:03:15.466 --> 00:03:18.328
Agnes let go, and left the dragon hanging.

38
00:03:20.290 --> 00:03:23.352
As the creature worked the spell, the witch sat down.

39
00:03:24.776 --> 00:03:27.979
She began to knit with her black cat lying beside her.

40
00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:31.223
"Settle in, Kitty.

41
00:03:31.243 --> 00:03:34.826
We'll wait here until the dragon is done!"
